+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html><head>
+<meta charset="utf-8">
+<!--
+Tests for the OpenGL ES 2.0 HTML Canvas context
+
+Copyright (C) 2011  Ilmari Heikkinen <ilmari.heikkinen@gmail.com>
